{
  "id": "the-simpsons---7x12---team-homer",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 7x12 - Team Homer",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 7x12 - Team Homer.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T21:03:00.543Z",
  "lineCount": 266,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The Simpsons",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3903,
      "endMs": 7202
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 15415,
      "endMs": 17508
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Oh, my God! The Mad magazine special edition.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 37203,
      "endMs": 40297
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "They only put out 17 of these a year!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 40407,
      "endMs": 43103
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Boy, they're really sockin' it to that Spiro Agnew guy again. He must work there or something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43209,
      "endMs": 48977
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Let's do the fold-in. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49082,
      "endMs": 51209
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "\"What higher power do TV evangelists worship?\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51317,
      "endMs": 54377
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "I'll say God. I'll sayJesus.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 54487,
      "endMs": 56580
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "\"The almighty dollar\"? You fold it, you bought it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56689,
      "endMs": 60921
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Whoo! \"Snappy answers to stupid questions. \" I'm great at these. Ask me if something smells funny in here, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61027,
      "endMs": 67158
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Does something smell funny in here? I don't think so, stupid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67267,
      "endMs": 71465
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Homie, you want pork chops? No, I want roast beef, you clod!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73506,
      "endMs": 77772
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Look at this. Special insert: \"Iron-on madness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79979,
      "endMs": 83574
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Ban the bath. Don't trust anyone over 10.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83683,
      "endMs": 86675
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Sock it to me!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86786,
      "endMs": 89050
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Those magazines create a dangerous amount of laughter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89155,
      "endMs": 94525
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "\"The 'all-ighty ollar\"'?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94627,
      "endMs": 98188
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "I get it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98298,
      "endMs": 100391
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Say, business stinks tonight. Where's Barney, Lenny and Carl?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100500,
      "endMs": 104266
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "They never come around anymore now that they got their mistresses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104370,
      "endMs": 108898
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Might as well close the dump.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109008,
      "endMs": 110942
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "I am gonna drink you under the table. No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 111044,
      "endMs": 113410
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "I am going to drink you under the- Well, you're closin'. It's gettin' late.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113513,
      "endMs": 120311
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "My kids are probably wondering where their daddy is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120420,
      "endMs": 123150
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "There's gotta be some other place we can go. Think, Moe! Think!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123256,
      "endMs": 126054
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Sorry. It's league night. I couldn't give a lane to my own mother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128695,
      "endMs": 132153
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "I have no son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 132265,
      "endMs": 134165
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Man, you go through life, you try to be nice to people... you struggle to resist the urge to punch 'em in the face, and for what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136269,
      "endMs": 143533
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "For some pimply little puke that treats ya like dirt unless you're on a team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143643,
      "endMs": 148103
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Well, I'm better than dirt. Well, most kinds of dirt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 148214,
      "endMs": 151980
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I mean, not that fancy, store-bought dirt. That stuff's loaded with nutrients.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152085,
      "endMs": 155145
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "I can't compete with that stuff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155255,
      "endMs": 157416
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "That I cannot bowl wreaks havoc with my self-esteem as well, but who am I to complain?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157524,
      "endMs": 162325
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Well, I'm tired of being a wannabe league bowler. I wanna be a league bowler!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162428,
      "endMs": 166865
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Hey, we can be a team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166966,
      "endMs": 170197
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Excuse me, but my team is ready to bowl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170303,
      "endMs": 174399
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "You're short one person. Uh... that long-haired freak's bowled with us for years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174507,
      "endMs": 180107
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "I don't care if it takes me all night. I'm gonna get me that lobster harmonica.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180213,
      "endMs": 184741
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Come on, lobstie. Whoo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184851,
      "endMs": 187217
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Oh, okay. Then I just need your $500 registration fee. $500!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187320,
      "endMs": 192849
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Oh, no problem. Would you take an out-of-state, two-party, bad check?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192959,
      "endMs": 196451
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "No, I will not pay you $500 for sex.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196563,
      "endMs": 199726
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Aw, come on, Marge. You're getting something in return, and I'm getting a bowling team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199832,
      "endMs": 205065
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "It's win-win. It's sick... and I don't have that kind of money to spend on sex.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 205171,
      "endMs": 210632
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Maybe you could get someone with money to sponsor your team, like Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210743,
      "endMs": 214679
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Burns never gives money to anybody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214781,
      "endMs": 216942
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Just last week, I asked him for $1,500. For what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217050,
      "endMs": 220076
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Oh, I gotta get the third degree from you too?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220186,
      "endMs": 222086
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Tonight's homework assignment is- Oh, man, is it hot in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222188,
      "endMs": 226124
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "I'd better take off my sweater.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226226,
      "endMs": 229161
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "\"Down with\"- \"homework\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229262,
      "endMs": 232959
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Don't look at it, children. His shirt makes a good point.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235935,
      "endMs": 238597
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I'm with the shirt! Homework rots!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238705,
      "endMs": 241299
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Down with homework! Down with homework!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241407,
      "endMs": 244308
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Mmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246779,
      "endMs": 250271
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "As I was saying, my yearly evaluation couldn't have come at a better time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 250383,
      "endMs": 254046
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Well, Seymour, I must say, for once, I am impressed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254153,
      "endMs": 257350
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "In fact, I am going to give this school a perfect 10.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 257457,
      "endMs": 261291
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I'll just write the zero first.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261394,
      "endMs": 264488
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Now a vertical line to indicate the one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264597,
      "endMs": 268192
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Down with homework!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 268301,
      "endMs": 270861
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Skinner, why are there children walking on my head?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270970,
      "endMs": 276203
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "So, we meet again, Mad magazine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278778,
      "endMs": 282578
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "How do you know it's from Mad? The year was 1968.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282682,
      "endMs": 285412
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "We were on recon in a steaming Mekong delta.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285518,
      "endMs": 288783
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "An overheated private removed his flak jacket, revealing a T-shirt... with an iron-on sporting the Mad slogan \"up with miniskirts. \" Well, we all had a good laugh, even though I didn't quite understand it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288888,
      "endMs": 298796
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "But our momentary lapse of concentration allowed Charlie to get the drop on us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298898,
      "endMs": 303335
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "I spent the next three years in a P.O.W. camp... forced to subsist on a thin stew made of fish, vegetables... prawns, coconut milk and four kinds of rice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 303436,
      "endMs": 313609
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "I came close to madness trying to find it here in the States... but they just can't get the spices right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 313713,
      "endMs": 318513
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Uh, my punishment? Hmm? Oh, I'm gonna have to think about that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 318618,
      "endMs": 321883
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Meanwhile, wear this home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 321988,
      "endMs": 324718
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "No-o-o. I need some more ether.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326459,
      "endMs": 330293
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "I can still feel the movement of the emery board.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 330396,
      "endMs": 334059
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "We're fresh out, sir. I'll get some more. Leave the rag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334167,
      "endMs": 337762
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Mmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337870,
      "endMs": 340168
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Uh, excuse me, Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343176,
      "endMs": 345838
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Pop 'n' Fresh, you glutinous little dough boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345945,
      "endMs": 349642
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "There's something I've wanted to do to you for years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349749,
      "endMs": 352877
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Ow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 355688,
      "endMs": 358885
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Mr. Burns, I was wondering if you'd like... to sponsor my bowling team for $500.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358991,
      "endMs": 365360
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Why, certainly, Pop 'n' Fresh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365465,
      "endMs": 367490
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "I owe my robust physique to your tubes of triple-bleached goo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367600,
      "endMs": 370728
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! Hey, everybody, if you wanna ask Burns for a favor, now's the time!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370837,
      "endMs": 376469
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "He's doped up or dyin' or somethin'!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376576,
      "endMs": 379409
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Uh, excuse me. I'd like to request $17... for a push broom rebristling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379512,
      "endMs": 386083
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Why, it's that delightful TV leprechaun! I'm going to get your Lucky Charms.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386185,
      "endMs": 391122
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Oh, no. My brains.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 391224,
      "endMs": 394557
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Hey, nice, quote, uniforms, end quote.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410410,
      "endMs": 414369
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "This just in. A new addition to our worst-dressed list: those guys!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 414480,
      "endMs": 418041
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Oh, forget this. I am far too fragile... to withstand an evening of barbs like that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 421354,
      "endMs": 427320
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Oh, come on. If we quit now, we'll never know how badly they're gonna beat us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 427427,
      "endMs": 431056
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Yeah, you're right. That's the kind of thing that would haunt ya.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431164,
      "endMs": 434190
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Hey! S�.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436068,
      "endMs": 438002
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": ": Buenas noches, senoritas.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438104,
      "endMs": 440971
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "What did he say? What did he say? Was that about me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 441073,
      "endMs": 443439
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Okay, Otto. Pressure's on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444577,
      "endMs": 446977
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Don't choke. Don't choke. Don't choke. Don't... choke.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447079,
      "endMs": 450879
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Oh, man! I knew I was gonna choke.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452385,
      "endMs": 454546
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "That's a funny-lookin' strike. Come on, guys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454654,
      "endMs": 457817
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Let's be the team that supports each other.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457924,
      "endMs": 460449
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "You can do it, Otto! You can do it, Otto!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460560,
      "endMs": 463256
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Help each other out! That'll be our motto!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463362,
      "endMs": 465990
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "You can do it, Otto! You can do it, Otto!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466098,
      "endMs": 468760
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Make this spare, I give you free gelato!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468868,
      "endMs": 471166
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Then back to my place, where I will get you blotto!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471270,
      "endMs": 473830
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Domo arigato, Mr. Roboto. You can do it, Otto! You can do it- Guys, I made the spare. We won.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473940,
      "endMs": 481272
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Yes! Yeah! All right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 482381,
      "endMs": 485350
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Those beers are five dollars apiece.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 488654,
      "endMs": 491214
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Let me set the scene for you, Marge. All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 498965,
      "endMs": 500956
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "It's a 7-10 split, the hardest shot in bowling. Uh-huh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 501067,
      "endMs": 504525
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "It was all up to me, so I got up all my courage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504637,
      "endMs": 508630
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Right away, my lips started to move... and I came up with a chant that won the match!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508741,
      "endMs": 514845
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Who knocked down the pins? I don't know. You know, some guy. Otto, I guess.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 514947,
      "endMs": 520112
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Good for him. Yes, but, Marge, you're missing the point.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520219,
      "endMs": 524986
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "The individual doesn't matter. It was a team effort.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525091,
      "endMs": 529323
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "And I was the one who came up with the whole team idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529428,
      "endMs": 533125
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Me. I can't believe Otto picked up a 7-10 split.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533232,
      "endMs": 537328
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "He's phenomenal. Wow. But- Several days ago, a violent riot erupted... incited by an inflammatory T-shirt slogan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537436,
      "endMs": 544703
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "No, no. Now, don't try to remember what that slogan was.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544810,
      "endMs": 548211
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "To ensure that this frenzied dance of destruction is never repeated...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 548314,
      "endMs": 551613
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "I've decided, starting Monday, all students will be required to wear uniforms.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551717,
      "endMs": 556416
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Huh? Uniforms?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556522,
      "endMs": 559457
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Say hello to our little genius, Martin, who looks even smarter... in this vest and short pant combination from Mr. Boy of Main Street.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 564463,
      "endMs": 573829
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Or how about little Lisa Simpson?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 573940,
      "endMs": 577376
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "She'll have no reason to play the blues in this snappy ensemble... topped off with a saucy French beret... that seems to scream \"silence. \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577476,
      "endMs": 587780
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "All right. Pick your size: extra small or extra large.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 592925,
      "endMs": 596019
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "We've got both. No pushing now. I-What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596128,
      "endMs": 599097
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Oh, I've just been informed we've run out of extra large.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599198,
      "endMs": 601894
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Go, Moe.! Go, Moe.! Don't make Homer shout out, \"D'oh.!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602001,
      "endMs": 606131
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606238,
      "endMs": 609867
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Yea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 616215,
      "endMs": 618547
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "All right, Snake. Make us proud.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 618651,
      "endMs": 620642
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, 10.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625658,
      "endMs": 628855
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Bye!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628961,
      "endMs": 630929
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Ah, we forfeit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631030,
      "endMs": 633191
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "We'll take it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633299,
      "endMs": 636166
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "There it is, boys: the championship trophy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 640406,
      "endMs": 643898
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Whoo. We will never possess it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644010,
      "endMs": 645978
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "The Holy Rollers have won it five years in a row.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646078,
      "endMs": 649013
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "They think they're so high and mighty... just 'cause they never got caught drivin' without pants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649115,
      "endMs": 654112
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "God boy couldn't get a strike!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657189,
      "endMs": 661785
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "It's me. Ned.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 663262,
      "endMs": 665287
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Mom, my slingshot doesn't fit in these pockets... and these shorts leave nothing to the imagination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668567,
      "endMs": 674833
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "These uniforms suck. Bart, where do you pick up words like that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674940,
      "endMs": 678432
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Yeah, Moe, that team sure did suck last night. Theyjust plain sucked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678544,
      "endMs": 681809
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "I've seen teams suck before, but they were the suckiest bunch of sucks that ever sucked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681914,
      "endMs": 685975
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Homer, watch your mouth! I gotta go. My damn wiener kids are listening.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686085,
      "endMs": 689919
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "We are not wieners. Then what are you dressed like that for?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690022,
      "endMs": 692786
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "They made us. Oh. \"They made us. \" That's loser talk. You gotta start acting more like me and my team... the future league champions of the world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692892,
      "endMs": 701393
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Nothing's gonna stop us now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 701500,
      "endMs": 703468
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Stop everything! I don't remember writing a check for bowling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703569,
      "endMs": 706936
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Sir, that's a check for your boweling. Oh, yes. That's very important.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707039,
      "endMs": 711442
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Yes, sir. Remember that month you didn't do it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711544,
      "endMs": 713444
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Yes, that was unpleasant for all concerned.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713546,
      "endMs": 715878
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Anyway, back to the checks. Stop everything!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 715981,
      "endMs": 718779
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "I don't remember writing a check for bowling. Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718884,
      "endMs": 722217
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "The memo says, \"To my pal, Pop 'n' Fresh. \" Oh, yes. That greedy, grasping glob of chemicals.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722321,
      "endMs": 727925
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Probably one of your ether-induced hallucinations, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 728027,
      "endMs": 730359
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "I'll check the employee files to see who could pull off such an impersonation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730463,
      "endMs": 733557
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "It was either Pops Freshenmeyer... or Homer Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735735,
      "endMs": 742330
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Simpson, eh? Let's shut down this bowling scam right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745044,
      "endMs": 749640
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Come on, Homer. Come on, Homer. Pretend this is baseball and hit us a homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754453,
      "endMs": 758514
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "You rolled it. You rolled it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760659,
      "endMs": 765790
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "By the way, rhyming \"Homer\" with \"Homer\"- Look at them, Smithers, enjoying their embezzlement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 765898,
      "endMs": 772704
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "I have a much uglier word for it, sir: misappropriation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772805,
      "endMs": 777037
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Simpson.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777143,
      "endMs": 780169
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Listen here. I want to join your team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780279,
      "endMs": 783510
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "You wanna join my what? You wanna what his team?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783616,
      "endMs": 785481
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "I've had one of my unpredictable changes of heart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785584,
      "endMs": 788144
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Seeing these fine young athletes reveling in the humiliation of a vanquished foe- I haven't felt this energized since my last... boweling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788254,
      "endMs": 797622
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Oh, man. He'll blow our winning streak.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 797730,
      "endMs": 799925
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Yeah. Call this an unfair generalization if you must... but old people are no good at everything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800032,
      "endMs": 806230
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Look, guys, it's not that simple. He's my boss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806338,
      "endMs": 808863
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "I'll tell you what. I'll give him a shot, and if he stinks... it'll be easier to tell him no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808974,
      "endMs": 814337
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Ooh-",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 817183,
      "endMs": 819777
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Welcome aboard!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826826,
      "endMs": 830387
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "It wasn't any easier.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 830496,
      "endMs": 832464
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Ah, these uniforms are a godsend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 838904,
      "endMs": 841031
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Horseplay's down 40%. Youthful exuberance has been cut in half.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 841140,
      "endMs": 844598
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "High spirits are at an all-time low.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 844710,
      "endMs": 847338
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "They've even begun blinking in unison. I love that sound.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 847446,
      "endMs": 852145
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Now, children, while you're having quiet time...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852251,
      "endMs": 855482
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "I'm going to make sure my desk is exactly parallel to the rear wall.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855588,
      "endMs": 859718
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Oh, there's something I used... to do in this situation, but can't remember.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863729,
      "endMs": 873027
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Ha- ho?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873138,
      "endMs": 875333
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "I can't believe I got booted off the team for Mr. Businessman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875441,
      "endMs": 879241
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "I bet I'll get a little respect once I get that Harvard diploma.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 879345,
      "endMs": 883441
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Look at that. All the way to the end with only one push.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893559,
      "endMs": 897655
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "That's the third game in a row he cost us, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 897763,
      "endMs": 901130
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Mamma mia.! Hoot, mon!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 901233,
      "endMs": 903633
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Yee-haw! Arr, me mateys. Arr.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903736,
      "endMs": 908105
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Whoo! They begged me to join their team- begged me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908207,
      "endMs": 910971
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Well, we certainly got walloped tonight, eh, fellas?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912912,
      "endMs": 916575
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Well- Uh, Mr. Burns, next week is the big championship game.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 916682,
      "endMs": 923552
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Ah, yes, that silly championship.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923656,
      "endMs": 926386
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "The only ship worth a damn is friendship.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926492,
      "endMs": 929427
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Look. Here comes the \"friend ship\" sailing your way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 929528,
      "endMs": 933624
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Ooh, here. Let me get that, friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933732,
      "endMs": 936428
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Oops. Lost a nail. Well, that's leprosy for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936535,
      "endMs": 941529
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "You're it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953953,
      "endMs": 955921
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Now you are the one who is it. Understood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956021,
      "endMs": 958683
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Well, I've gotta hand it to you, Seymour. These drab student coverings... have created the perfect distraction-free environment... thus preparing the children for permanent positions in tomorrow's mills... and processing facilities.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958791,
      "endMs": 971095
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Best of all, with less than a minute to go before I leave... absolutely nothing has gone wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971203,
      "endMs": 977272
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Well, it is starting to rain, but I could hardly be blamed for that, can I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979244,
      "endMs": 983977
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Yes. Very good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 986819,
      "endMs": 989287
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Wow! Look at all the colors, man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 997396,
      "endMs": 1000194
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Red, green, yellow, orange! I remember all of these!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000299,
      "endMs": 1003359
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "I'm freaking out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1003469,
      "endMs": 1006233
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Hey, something's comin' back to me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006338,
      "endMs": 1009569
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Down with homework! And down with uniforms.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009675,
      "endMs": 1013441
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Yea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1013545,
      "endMs": 1015638
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Ow, ow, ow, ow! Skinner... why aren't these uniforms colorfast?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017883,
      "endMs": 1021412
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "I don't understand it. I got them at the same place I buy Mother's dresses, and-",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027126,
      "endMs": 1030061
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Good Lord! Mother's in the park! This I've gotta see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030162,
      "endMs": 1034223
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Oh, Marge, we were so close to winning the championship.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034333,
      "endMs": 1038167
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Now, thanks to Burns, it's never gonna happen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038270,
      "endMs": 1040170
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "And I spent so much time building that trophy case.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040272,
      "endMs": 1044208
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Homer, maybe Mr. Burns will bowl a great game, and you will win your championship.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047112,
      "endMs": 1051640
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "So you're saying we're definitely gonna win? Whoo-hoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051750,
      "endMs": 1055914
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I won't need this anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056021,
      "endMs": 1060253
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Marge, someone broke the toilet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064329,
      "endMs": 1067230
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Don't worry about nothin', Homer. I have a feeling... that Mr. Burns is gonna have a little accident that might keep him... from bowlin' with us tonight, heh, heh, heh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075140,
      "endMs": 1086139
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Smithers, I'm afraid I won't be able to play tonight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089421,
      "endMs": 1092549
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "My old gimpy knee has gone akimbo again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092658,
      "endMs": 1095058
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Take that! Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095160,
      "endMs": 1098152
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Smithers, that precision assault popped it back into place. Thank you, masked stranger!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098263,
      "endMs": 1103132
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "D'oh! He's gonna ruin everything! All right. That's it, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103235,
      "endMs": 1105965
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Either Burns goes, or Moe goes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106071,
      "endMs": 1108062
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Yes, I am afraid that I am going to have to make a similar threat... with my name in place of Moe's name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108173,
      "endMs": 1112936
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "So, who's ready to kick some Christian keister?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113045,
      "endMs": 1115843
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Oh, uh, Mr. Burns, as team captain... it's my duty to inform you that- Ooh, I almost forgot! I brought you all a little something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115948,
      "endMs": 1125818
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Aww, would you look at that? The \"Pin Pals. \" At last, I finally have a garment fine enough to be married in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127493,
      "endMs": 1135461
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "I've always been wealthy, but this is the first time I ever felt... rich.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135567,
      "endMs": 1140402
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Aww. Now, Homer, you were about to say something to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1140506,
      "endMs": 1144442
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "You're off the team. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1144543,
      "endMs": 1147535
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "He's just ribbin' ya, Monty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147646,
      "endMs": 1152049
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152151,
      "endMs": 1154676
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Had you going there. Guys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154786,
      "endMs": 1156811
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Hey, hey, hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161927,
      "endMs": 1165021
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Hallelujah. Hallelujah.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174373,
      "endMs": 1178469
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Aww.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178577,
      "endMs": 1181569
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Nice one, Homer. Thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185083,
      "endMs": 1187449
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Okay. The Holy Rollers are ahead by one pin... and we only have one bowler left: Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1189421,
      "endMs": 1196624
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196728,
      "endMs": 1199356
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Well, next time, a few steps more toward center, don't you think?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209575,
      "endMs": 1213238
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Good-bye, trophy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1213345,
      "endMs": 1215313
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Ooh. Whatever I got ahold of is big.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1225123,
      "endMs": 1228422
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Yes! Excellent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1244109,
      "endMs": 1245770
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Yes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1247079,
      "endMs": 1249138
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! We won! We won!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1249248,
      "endMs": 1253708
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "You mean, I won. But we were a team, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1260025,
      "endMs": 1262721
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Oh, I'm afraid I've had one of my trademark changes of heart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1262828,
      "endMs": 1265695
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "You see, teamwork will only take you so far.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1265797,
      "endMs": 1267765
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Then the truly evolved person makes that extra grab for personal glory.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1267866,
      "endMs": 1272132
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Now I must discard my teammates, much like the boxer must shed roll after roll... of sweaty, useless, disgusting flab before he can win the title.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1272237,
      "endMs": 1279807
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Ta. I guess some people never change.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1279911,
      "endMs": 1283506
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Or they quickly change and then quickly change back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1283615,
      "endMs": 1287517
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "You know what? We don't need him or his trophy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1287619,
      "endMs": 1290884
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "We got each other, huh? Yeah, yeah. That's right, Moe. Aww.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1290989,
      "endMs": 1295722
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Go, Homer, you're our man! If you can't do it, nobody can!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1295827,
      "endMs": 1299263
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1305370,
      "endMs": 1307031
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "No! Oh, God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1307139,
      "endMs": 1312008
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Well, I guess no one can. Run, before they're through feeding!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1312110,
      "endMs": 1316376
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "No.! Oh, God.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1316481,
      "endMs": 1320440
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "No.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1320552,
      "endMs": 1322486
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1362461,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 7,
    "episode": 12
  }
}
